  m_Name: Site01_Locator
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MarsSampling.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: 'Locator fix is in. Site 1: MS-grid 127.80E / 20.80N.'
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: That's 63 metres out from the rover. Spacing rule says fifty minimum between
      sites, so we're clear.
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: 'Grab something representative. Which means: the most boring rock you can
      find. I know. I''m sorry.'
